    {
      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "AND2",
        "Description": "AND reading (inputs A and B, BIAS and BIAS2 constantly on, threshold 0.25) of the shipped \u0027Logic Gate AND-from-NAND\u0027 gate. Role in the 4-bit AND: bit slice 2 of the ISA AND datapath \u2014 Y2 = A2 AND B2. The 4-bit word operation composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each slice restores clean 0/1 levels by construction and the four slices run side by side without a single wire between them.",
        "Identifier": "group_b609a11b4e624663aca3f375e162efb0",
        "IdGuid": "307f566c-24d2-471d-af2d-a79337d3cf1a",
