    {
      "GroupDto": {
        "GroupName": "AND3",
        "Description": "AND reading (inputs A and B, BIAS and BIAS2 constantly on, threshold 0.25) of the shipped \u0027Logic Gate AND-from-NAND\u0027 gate. Role in the 4-bit AND: bit slice 3 of the ISA AND datapath \u2014 Y3 = A3 AND B3. The 4-bit word operation composes at the logic layer, not optically: every gate\u0027s truth table is extracted once in isolation, so each slice restores clean 0/1 levels by construction and the four slices run side by side without a single wire between them.",
        "Identifier": "group_ff7d8f87f4d14956aeb2cb241907ce4b",
